    scallop-meat-...-sunset          ARCHIVED (also: ops says 16oz, product
                                     title says 20oz — reconcile before relist)
    dave-s-gourmet-pickled-ginger-4oz ARCHIVED
    caleta-bay-a-i-steelhead-loin-12oz UNLISTED

  KNOWN LIMITATION — single-variant products never reach this snippet.
  product-card.liquid only computes a per-serving price when it can parse a
  pack count from a variant title ("12-Pack" -> 12). Products whose only
  variant is "Default Title" fall back to the normal price display, so
  yugeta-shoyu-4oz (20 servings) and dave-s-gourmet-pickled-ginger-4oz
  (4 servings) will not show a per-serving price even though they are mapped.
  Fixing that means treating an unparseable variant as 1 package, which would
  add "/serving" to every single-variant product on the site — a bigger
  change than this one, so it is deliberately not done here.
{%- endcomment -%}
